00:14:53,160 --> 00:14:53,990
Taya, wait.

251
00:14:54,360 --> 00:14:57,760
My Deckmaster ability allows
us to communicate mentally.

252
00:14:58,120 --> 00:14:59,414
I'm here to guide you.

253
00:14:59,860 --> 00:15:01,720
Okay, you have my trust.

254
00:15:03,360 --> 00:15:05,680
Now I activate this card.

255
00:15:06,140 --> 00:15:07,552
Offerings to the doomed.

256
00:15:09,680 --> 00:15:12,580
Looks like I've got this
duel all wrapped up,

257
00:15:12,700 --> 00:15:15,737
because my magic card
destroys one of your monsters.

258
00:15:15,820 --> 00:15:16,761
See you, Sneaky.

259
00:15:18,480 --> 00:15:20,540
Now for my face-down monster.

260
00:15:20,800 --> 00:15:23,077
I'll switch it from
defense to attack mode.

261
00:15:23,160 --> 00:15:25,440
Reveal, Fire Sorcerer!

262
00:15:30,040 --> 00:15:31,440
Pretty cool, right?

263
00:15:31,760 --> 00:15:35,020
And now, it's time to
warm things up a bit.

264
00:15:43,940 --> 00:15:45,000
Much better.

265
00:15:45,340 --> 00:15:50,577
Next, I'll activate Fire Sorcerer's special
ability by discarding two of my cards.

266
00:15:50,660 --> 00:15:53,840
I'm able to burn through
800 of your life points.

267
00:16:00,340 --> 00:16:03,222
And don't think I'm finished
with you yet, Crunk!

268
00:16:04,640 --> 00:16:05,680
Fire sorcerer!

269
00:16:05,840 --> 00:16:07,620
Put that bird on the hot seat!

270
00:16:13,260 --> 00:16:17,440
And since you lost life points, your
own rule gets turned against you.

271
00:16:17,720 --> 00:16:19,426
How do you like being frozen?

272
00:16:19,700 --> 00:16:21,440
I absolutely love it.

273
00:16:21,680 --> 00:16:25,637
If you hadn't noticed, I'm a penguin,
and we like things on the cool side.

274
00:16:25,720 --> 00:16:28,280
Or do you need a lesson
on Antarctic birds?

275
00:16:28,520 --> 00:16:31,297
Well, now that you mention it,
I do have a question, Crump.

276
00:16:31,380 --> 00:16:33,237
Where did I get my good looks from?

277
00:16:33,320 --> 00:16:34,150
No, not quite.

278
00:16:34,240 --> 00:16:36,617
I want to know why you're
so obsessed with penguins.

279
00:16:36,700 --> 00:16:40,117
Not that it's any of your business,
but when I was a young man,

280
00:16:40,200 --> 00:16:44,137
these little flightless birds saved
me from living a life of misery.

281
00:16:44,220 --> 00:16:47,437
You see, I was an only child,
and my parents were never around.

282
00:16:47,520 --> 00:16:51,167
They worked late and were too
tired to spend any time with me.

283
00:16:51,280 --> 00:16:55,140
So to entertain myself, I would
sit for hours and count things.

284
00:16:55,500 --> 00:16:59,265
Crumbs on the rug, dots on the
wallpaper, whatever I could find.

285
00:16:59,400 --> 00:17:04,540
Then one day, while counting books on the
shelf, I discovered a book about penguins.

286
00:17:04,800 --> 00:17:06,877
I learned that a mother and father penguin

287
00:17:06,960 --> 00:17:09,740
actually take turns sitting on their eggs.

288
00:17:10,080 --> 00:17:14,317
These birds had a bond with their
children that I never knew could exist.

289
00:17:14,400 --> 00:17:17,900
From then on, my life
revolved around my two loves,

290
00:17:18,120 --> 00:17:22,200
numbers and penguins, and
I devoted myself to both.

291
00:17:22,740 --> 00:17:27,200
As I grew, I dreamt of a career that
would combine my two great passions.

292
00:17:27,580 --> 00:17:30,080
Then one day, that dream almost came true.

293
00:17:30,440 --> 00:17:33,357
I climbed my way to the top
of the Kaiba Corporation

294
00:17:33,440 --> 00:17:36,397
as the company's chief
accountant and number expert.

295
00:17:36,480 --> 00:17:41,877
And I had an idea that would have tripled
our profits at all-penguin theme park.

296
00:17:41,960 --> 00:17:44,820
So, I brought my proposal to Seto Kaiba.

297
00:17:45,300 --> 00:17:47,080
Please, don't waste my time.

298
00:17:47,500 --> 00:17:50,260
We're a gaming corporation,
not a petting zoo.

299
00:17:50,860 --> 00:17:52,957
Look, Crump, stick to your calculator.

300
00:17:53,040 --> 00:17:55,577
That good-for-nothing
punk shut down my dream,

301
00:17:55,660 --> 00:17:59,072
and once I'm free from here,
I'll finally have my revenge!

302
00:17:59,260 --> 00:18:01,237
But what does that have to do with me?

303
00:18:01,320 --> 00:18:06,060
I told you I need a human body in
order to escape from this cyber realm.

304
00:18:06,280 --> 00:18:09,157
You just happen to be in the
wrong place at the wrong time.

305
00:18:09,240 --> 00:18:12,837
In the future, be more careful
about who you hang around with.

306
00:18:12,920 --> 00:18:16,979
Of course, the odds of you actually
having a future are slim to none.

307
00:18:17,100 --> 00:18:20,697
So let's continue this duel so I
can get out of this place already.

308
00:18:20,780 --> 00:18:23,880
Now I summon Flying Penguin.

309
00:18:26,920 --> 00:18:29,740
And thanks to my
Deckmaster's special ability,

310
00:18:30,000 --> 00:18:32,380
it gains 200 attack points right away.

311
00:18:32,700 --> 00:18:34,237
But that's just the beginning.

312
00:18:34,320 --> 00:18:39,500
Next, I'll play Penguin Sword, raising
its attack strength 800 more points.

313
00:18:39,880 --> 00:18:40,940
That's not good.

314
00:18:41,140 --> 00:18:42,258
My monster's toast.

315
00:18:43,040 --> 00:18:43,870
That's right.

316
00:18:43,960 --> 00:18:47,320
And now, my flying penguin,
attack her fire sorcerer.

317
00:18:50,920 --> 00:18:52,440
That's my last defense.

318
00:18:53,400 --> 00:18:57,120
And since you lost more life
points, the freezing continues.

319
00:18:57,540 --> 00:18:58,660
You're sick.

320
00:18:58,960 --> 00:19:00,780
It'll all be over soon, Taya.

321
00:19:01,000 --> 00:19:02,997
Your life points are down almost 50%,

322
00:19:03,080 --> 00:19:05,917
And with no more defensive
monsters to hide behind,

323
00:19:06,000 --> 00:19:07,217
you're out in the cold.

324
00:19:07,300 --> 00:19:08,460
You wish!

325
00:19:11,060 --> 00:19:13,236
We don't seem to be getting anywhere.

326
00:19:13,720 --> 00:19:14,920
It's freezing!

327
00:19:15,340 --> 00:19:16,680
My legs are numb!

328
00:19:17,080 --> 00:19:18,380
We're coming, Taya!

329
00:19:18,780 --> 00:19:21,368
We gotta find our way
out of here right now!

330
00:19:22,700 --> 00:19:23,530
Hmm.

331
00:19:23,613 --> 00:19:24,840
Yugi, look on the floor.

332
00:19:26,540 --> 00:19:27,370
Huh?

333
00:19:27,453 --> 00:19:29,037
That's the same coin I threw at the door!

334
00:19:29,120 --> 00:19:33,997
we were here before so that means
we've just been running around

335
00:19:34,080 --> 00:19:40,760
in circles a little chilly are we
that's the least of your worries

336
00:19:59,740 --> 00:20:00,877
Yu-Gi-Oh! Yu

337
00:20:00,960 --> 00:20:07,960
-Gi

338
00:20:17,200 --> 00:20:18,030
-Oh!
